# VHS tape: modforge status demo
# Run with: vhs demo/status.tape
# Requires: modforge installed (no token needed)

Output demo/status.gif
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "modforge --version"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "modforge status"
Enter
Sleep 3s
